6: Conclusion and Future Directions

Conclusion:
The GNN-SA framework addresses urban challenges effectively, offering scalable and sustainable solutions. It demonstrates significant improvements in traffic management, resource allocation, and infrastructure optimization. By integrating advanced AI techniques with robust optimization algorithms, this methodology provides a comprehensive approach to enhancing urban systems. Its relevance to real-world applications underscores its potential as a cornerstone for future smart city initiatives.

Future Research:

